program	errors/deinit_needs_copy_policy.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`Res` declares a deinit but no copy policy
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `Res` declares a deinit but no copy policy"
log	"  --> examples/errors/deinit_needs_copy_policy.saw:14:1"
log	"     |"
log	" 14 | extension Res: Deinit {"
log	"     | ^"
log	"   hint: declare one of `extension Res: NoCopy {}` (move-only), `ExplicitCopy`, or `Copy`, and put the `deinit` body inside it — every copy policy already requires `Deinit`"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
